              "text": "simultaneamente — \"simultaneously, at the same time\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Os dois telefones tocaram simultaneamente. The two phones rang at the same time."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built on simultâneo, ‘happening together’."
            }
          ]
